\[
\frac{2}{3} \div \frac{3}{5}
= \frac{2}{3} \times \frac{5}{3}
\]

Now multiply across:

\[
\frac{2 \times 5}{3 \times 3}=\frac{10}{9}
\]

Final answer:

\[
\boxed{\frac{10}{9}}
